{"title":"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/0/12006bda7ad3c078713cd1e35b929f5a976e8583.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = (\\log_82)^{(\\log_28)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"133\" height=\"20\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/f/d7fd1340cb24d52649cfba31d7a627f2b3f495c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_3x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"17\" /> equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/2/c12e60b3d765dcee97366148ef3c8170fe155bc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\ - 3 \\qquad \\text{(B)} \\ - \\frac13 \\qquad \\text{(C)} \\ \\frac13 \\qquad \\text{(D)} \\ 3 \\qquad \\text{(E)} \\ 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"382\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By definition, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/e/bfe2df61c5e3b9eff05dd871b81d957e442e45f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 2 = \\frac 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"79\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/c/27cc186429e476023816d7bfc181b8ca1ab94cdb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2 8 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"76\" height=\"17\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/9/ec906eae8cb7b1d98aa356b4e604afb1ea64c6c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_3 \\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\right)^3 = \\log_3 3^{-3} = -3 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"267\" height=\"46\" />. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME\" title=\"1966 AHSME\">1966 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1966 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1966\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=